((id "T48")
 (title "Parse MSBuild and Python traceback diagnostics from failed checks")
 (status done)
 (priority 2)
 (goal
  "When a check fails at build or import time, `file(line,col): error CSnnnn: msg` and Python `File \"f\", line N` / SyntaxError blocks become located findings through the same parser registry, so compile errors in `done` read like test failures.")
