 (log
  (((agent "xl1")
    (kind note)
    (seq 162)
    (text
     "parse-diagnostics(output) in testparse.rkt: MSBuild (path(line,col): error CSnnnn: msg [proj], deduped since MSBuild prints each diagnostic twice) and Python tracebacks (last frame = where it happened, not the caller; exception chaining -> multiple failures). Only consulted in check-findings when parse-test-output found nothing, so a build failure never masquerades as a test failure; new finding kinds diag-failed/diag-failed-more and E1 class build-failed keep the distinction through to the taxonomy. Fixtures: two real dotnet builds of a broken GuardClauses copy (one syntax CS1026, one CS0103+2 warnings) and two real python3 tracebacks (ZeroDivisionError, ModuleNotFoundError).")
